WEBVTT

00:13.830 --> 00:19.000
TSUKIMICHI -MOONLIT FANTASY- SEASON 2

01:30.650 --> 01:32.360
NIGHT 23: NEMESIS REVENGE MATCH
Sophia Bulga.

01:32.360 --> 01:33.570
NIGHT 23: NEMESIS REVENGE MATCH
Correct.

01:33.570 --> 01:35.830
It's my honor that you still remember me.

01:36.130 --> 01:37.870
You survived, after all.

01:37.870 --> 01:40.620
I was hoping that...

01:41.010 --> 01:43.100
...the so-called Devil
had taken you out.

01:43.100 --> 01:44.210
Wait...

01:44.670 --> 01:47.390
Does he not know he's the Devil?

01:47.390 --> 01:48.170
What is it?

01:49.420 --> 01:50.670
Forget it.

01:50.670 --> 01:52.630
I'm delighted to see you again.

01:52.630 --> 01:54.890
You actually survived my slash.

01:55.350 --> 01:58.390
That makes you a lot stronger
than Gritonia's hero.

01:59.270 --> 02:01.270
Did you kill their hero?

02:01.270 --> 02:03.770
No. Not yet, at least.

02:03.770 --> 02:06.700
He showed me something
that piqued my interest.

02:06.700 --> 02:08.650
So, I decided to spare his life.

02:09.150 --> 02:11.420
Can't you just leave us today?

02:11.420 --> 02:13.950
It looks like you got
plenty of entertainment from me.

02:14.270 --> 02:15.910
No can do.

02:16.570 --> 02:18.330
Heavenly Sword and I...

02:18.330 --> 02:21.950
both agreed to inflict
maximum damage on you.

02:21.950 --> 02:24.370
I'm going to obliterate you today.

02:25.980 --> 02:27.500
If I'm going to fight this foe,

02:28.230 --> 02:31.300
I must be more focused
than when I fought Io.

02:31.790 --> 02:32.880
Both of you, stop!

02:33.340 --> 02:34.130
Huh?

02:34.490 --> 02:36.800
Rona? What are you doing here?

02:36.800 --> 02:38.640
Sophia, listen up...

02:39.890 --> 02:40.850
Kuzunoha?

02:41.180 --> 02:43.600
What? This kid is Kuzunoha?

02:44.020 --> 02:46.920
Hold on.
You know Rona too?

02:46.920 --> 02:49.770
I thought something felt off.

02:49.770 --> 02:51.980
When did you learn to speak?

02:51.980 --> 02:53.440
The Common Tongue?

02:53.440 --> 02:54.650
Just now.

02:54.650 --> 02:56.740
Kuzunoha, what is going on here?

02:57.170 --> 02:59.580
Shouldn't you be in Rotsgard?

02:59.580 --> 03:00.790
Well...

03:01.120 --> 03:03.940
He seems to have made a deal
with the goddess...

03:03.940 --> 03:07.420
to help the empire's hero
retake Fort Stellar.

03:07.420 --> 03:10.750
You're doing
the goddess's bidding, after all.

03:10.750 --> 03:13.550
It was nothing but business.

03:13.550 --> 03:15.340
I am not her pawn.

03:15.340 --> 03:18.340
It's a shame to hear that, Kuzunoha.

03:18.340 --> 03:21.760
You treat all demi-humans
and demons as equals.

03:21.760 --> 03:24.310
I was planning to bring you
to the Demon King.

03:24.650 --> 03:27.940
I never said I'd side with the demons.

03:27.940 --> 03:31.520
It's the same as what you did
in Rotsgard, Rona.

03:31.520 --> 03:33.550
Rona...

03:33.550 --> 03:36.650
Just a while ago,
you still addressed me as Mrs. Rona.

03:38.280 --> 03:42.160
Seeing you barely had
any attachment for the humans,

03:42.160 --> 03:45.960
I thought you'd thank me
for my work in Rotsgard.

03:45.960 --> 03:49.710
The whole thing would have
benefited your business.

03:50.170 --> 03:52.000
You were too nosy.

03:52.000 --> 03:54.210
I've already cleared the streets.

03:54.210 --> 03:56.880
Yes. I received the reports.

03:56.880 --> 03:59.300
The demons should've left by now.

04:00.600 --> 04:01.760
Indeed, the demons left.

04:02.260 --> 04:04.220
I see.
The demi-humans.

04:04.620 --> 04:09.440
The luxurious residential area might be
where the mastermind is.

04:10.240 --> 04:12.550
There were demi-humans
in that city who sided...

04:12.550 --> 04:15.280
with the demons out of
their hate for the humans.

04:15.860 --> 04:18.740
So, how about we make another deal?

04:19.660 --> 04:23.160
I'll help you do business
in the demons' territories.

04:23.160 --> 04:25.580
In exchange, I need you to leave.

04:25.580 --> 04:27.200
I refuse.

04:27.200 --> 04:30.120
You and Io should go back
to your stronghold.

04:31.070 --> 04:33.340
Withdraw all of your troops
from Fort Stellar.

04:34.380 --> 04:36.420
Sophia and Io are both here.

04:36.420 --> 04:37.590
You think you can win?

04:38.170 --> 04:40.260
That's not your concern.

04:40.260 --> 04:43.130
You could join the fight if you wish.

04:44.300 --> 04:45.220
Rona.

04:45.220 --> 04:47.640
He is not bluffing.

04:47.640 --> 04:51.520
I couldn't land a hit on him
even after using the Rose Sign.

04:51.520 --> 04:53.150
The Rose Sign?

04:53.150 --> 04:55.860
Io! Have you lost your mind?

04:56.360 --> 04:59.360
I can't let only my soldiers use it.

04:59.360 --> 05:01.320
As long as I can take out the hero,

05:01.320 --> 05:03.620
I don't mind
letting someone else take my place.

05:04.160 --> 05:06.790
Don't take this so lightly!

05:06.790 --> 05:09.540
We may have different ways
to show our loyalty,

05:09.540 --> 05:11.750
but I recognize your strength.

05:12.100 --> 05:14.340
Sorry.

05:14.340 --> 05:16.960
How much time do you have left?

05:16.960 --> 05:21.470
Well, Kuzunoha stopped me
halfway through the activation.

05:22.890 --> 05:26.760
There's no telling what he did,
but I probably won't die.

05:27.770 --> 05:30.140
You should've led with that!

05:30.140 --> 05:31.620
Don't beat around the bush.

05:36.070 --> 05:40.110
Io couldn't beat you
even after sacrificing his life force.

05:40.720 --> 05:43.990
Perhaps there's no way to win this fight
unless I use my full power.

05:43.990 --> 05:46.120
The full power of the Dragon Slayer?

05:46.120 --> 05:48.700
I wouldn't want to
get caught up in the fight.

05:49.140 --> 05:50.710
I wish I could do the same.

05:50.710 --> 05:52.670
Come on, don't give me that.

05:53.330 --> 05:57.110
You've earned the right
to face my full power.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.630
By the way, Rona,

05:59.630 --> 06:04.680
I finally remember the name of the Devil
from my battle at Star Lake.

06:04.680 --> 06:06.010
Why bring that up now?

06:07.720 --> 06:12.020
Let's have a rematch,
Devil Kuzunoha!

06:14.350 --> 06:15.350
Devil?

06:16.150 --> 06:17.020
Me?

06:22.240 --> 06:23.650
She vanished.

06:23.650 --> 06:26.620
There's no telling
where she'll attack from.

06:28.440 --> 06:29.450
This is...

06:31.250 --> 06:32.750
What in the world is that?

06:34.870 --> 06:36.750
In our last battle,

06:36.750 --> 06:39.960
your surprise attack caused me
a great deal of trouble.

06:42.840 --> 06:45.180
To counter that,
I found a way to get stronger.

06:47.550 --> 06:48.610
Darkness?

06:49.140 --> 06:51.310
She can now control
even more elements.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.480
What's the matter?

06:55.480 --> 06:57.480
You didn't even scratch me.

06:57.480 --> 06:59.690
Darkness magic aside,

06:59.690 --> 07:01.120
you actually withstood...

07:01.120 --> 07:03.430
the Blade Dragon's sword
and the Flame Dragon's fire.

07:03.430 --> 07:05.430
Are these supposed
to be your best attacks?

07:05.430 --> 07:07.290
Why not give it another shot?

07:07.290 --> 07:08.240
Well then...

07:08.660 --> 07:10.660
I'll do just that!

07:13.900 --> 07:16.540
Is that his real armor?

07:17.040 --> 07:19.290
Is that thing made out of mana?

07:19.290 --> 07:20.590
I can't believe this.

07:21.000 --> 07:24.760
This thing can easily withstand
the Dragon Slayer's attacks.

07:24.760 --> 07:26.930
I'm even more confident
with its strength now.

07:27.330 --> 07:31.140
Kuzunoha,
you upgraded your defense skills.

07:31.140 --> 07:34.100
Yes. It's the materialization of mana.

07:34.100 --> 07:35.600
That's about it.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.600
Materialization of mana?

07:37.600 --> 07:39.980
I've never heard anything about that.

07:39.980 --> 07:41.070
I expected as much.

07:41.450 --> 07:43.820
My turn now.

07:50.930 --> 07:52.790
Incredible! Utterly incredible!

07:52.790 --> 07:55.010
This is the strength
of a boy from another world!

07:55.010 --> 07:57.420
This is the might of a human!

07:57.420 --> 08:00.750
It's the very reason
I can't resist getting involved.

08:01.380 --> 08:03.090
Dragon Slayer Sophia,

08:03.090 --> 08:05.710
you've done well.

08:05.710 --> 08:09.720
I bet you never expected
to be used as a camera.

08:10.040 --> 08:14.890
One of the ultimate goals of alchemy is
to produce the Philosopher's Stone.

08:14.890 --> 08:17.020
Without any impurity in it,

08:17.020 --> 08:19.690
it's the true form of Elixir,

08:19.690 --> 08:22.690
prima materia made of mana.

08:23.360 --> 08:26.940
He said he wanted to increase
his mana output,

08:27.330 --> 08:30.910
but I never thought he'd accomplish that
in such a bizarre way.

08:31.260 --> 08:34.990
You have more mana than me.

08:34.990 --> 08:37.500
Why would you want more mana?

08:37.500 --> 08:39.670
No, I meant the power of my spells.

08:39.670 --> 08:43.290
Well, I want to increase my mana output.

08:43.920 --> 08:46.340
The efficiency is still too low.

08:46.340 --> 08:47.970
You know,

08:47.970 --> 08:51.800
your mana pool is a talent
you can't strengthen by training.

08:52.220 --> 08:55.810
But the maximum limit of my mana
seems to be always increasing.

08:56.270 --> 08:59.980
Materializing mana
and maintaining it outside the body?

08:59.980 --> 09:03.020
Just how much mana
does one need to pull this off?

09:03.480 --> 09:05.440
This is utterly insane.

09:05.440 --> 09:07.360
An astounding accomplishment.

09:07.360 --> 09:08.240
It's a great feat.

09:09.610 --> 09:10.700
Makoto.

09:11.200 --> 09:17.080
You're the very manifestation
of the goal I've longed to realize.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.540
My heart is racing.

09:20.960 --> 09:22.370
I feel my mind slipping away.

09:22.370 --> 09:25.030
I'm thrilled beyond words.

09:28.800 --> 09:30.590
Your speed isn't all that impressive.

09:33.800 --> 09:36.760
Because I'm not a martial arts expert.

09:37.850 --> 09:40.060
But your attacks pack a lot of power.

09:40.570 --> 09:43.400
Did you get your power from
Greater Dragons other than Lancer?

09:44.880 --> 09:46.320
She teleported again.

09:46.320 --> 09:48.820
There's no way Lancer's sword is moving.

09:48.820 --> 09:51.070
Is this the power of a Shadow Dragon?

09:53.240 --> 09:54.490
A ranged attack?

10:03.670 --> 10:05.250
That looks like a laser beam.

10:05.960 --> 10:07.450
That didn't work either...

10:07.940 --> 10:11.470
The Flame Dragon Crimson Lapis,
the Greater Dragon of Fire...

10:11.470 --> 10:13.970
It has the highest
attack power among the dragons.

10:13.970 --> 10:15.090
Good grief.

10:15.090 --> 10:18.010
You kept using the power
of the Greater Dragons.

10:18.010 --> 10:20.680
I don't remember
getting on their bad side.

10:20.680 --> 10:22.730
Don't worry.

10:22.730 --> 10:25.150
It's not you that they hate.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.270
You blocked that attack.

10:34.780 --> 10:36.410
How about this?

10:38.370 --> 10:40.740
That armor can do
more than just defend?

10:46.420 --> 10:47.630
Perception Realm.

10:49.920 --> 10:50.880
Found you.

10:53.170 --> 10:54.260
The beam bent!

11:09.190 --> 11:10.370
Io.

11:10.900 --> 11:13.400
It's best you don't try to act imposing.

11:13.780 --> 11:15.320
If you get in my way,

11:15.320 --> 11:17.280
I won't hesitate to act.

11:17.820 --> 11:22.330
I haven't given up
on my fight with you.

11:22.330 --> 11:23.330
Is that so?

11:23.330 --> 11:24.750
Don't say I didn't warn you.

11:26.290 --> 11:27.810
I remember now.

11:28.350 --> 11:31.960
You're really good at detecting
the location of your foes.

11:33.170 --> 11:35.010
You can do regeneration now.

11:35.520 --> 11:37.510
But that must have hurt a lot.

11:37.510 --> 11:39.090
It's time we end this.

11:39.800 --> 11:42.310
Four Greater Dragons.

11:43.970 --> 11:47.140
Not just the Heavenly Sword
and the Waterfall.

11:47.140 --> 11:49.900
After our battle,
I reached the surface of the lake.

11:49.900 --> 11:52.230
I devoured Night Clad and Crimson Lapis.

11:52.550 --> 11:53.690
Devoured?

11:54.130 --> 11:56.700
Don't you get your power
from the Greater Dragons?

11:57.210 --> 12:00.950
I devour dragons and absorb their power.

12:00.950 --> 12:04.160
Inside me is the power to raze
an entire nation to the ground.

12:04.580 --> 12:06.120
That's quite a bluff.

12:06.120 --> 12:09.630
Or perhaps this world
is a lot more fragile than I know?

12:10.060 --> 12:13.590
By devouring Sand Wave and Invincible,
I can finally defeat him.

12:14.380 --> 12:16.470
I can take down even the Myriad Color.

12:16.810 --> 12:18.140
Myriad Color...

12:18.880 --> 12:20.930
Her real target is Luto.

12:31.830 --> 12:33.320
Darn it.

12:33.320 --> 12:34.780
I didn't want to have scales.

12:34.780 --> 12:37.150
It's very uncool.

12:37.150 --> 12:38.820
This is all your fault.

12:38.820 --> 12:39.990
It's time for you to pay.

12:39.990 --> 12:41.350
A transformation?

12:41.870 --> 12:45.740
I don't think that's enough
to defeat Shin and Luto.

12:46.370 --> 12:48.710
Shin and Luto?

12:49.330 --> 12:53.210
It seems there is more info
that I need to get out of you.

12:53.210 --> 12:55.250
Shin the Invincible is one thing,

12:55.250 --> 12:58.920
but almost no one alive knows
the real name of Myriad Color.

12:58.920 --> 13:01.220
I see.

13:01.220 --> 13:03.680
But we've been
having dinner together lately.

13:03.990 --> 13:06.230
Don't you dare look down on me!

13:13.980 --> 13:16.570
The strength of my mana mass
was reduced.

13:20.150 --> 13:22.200
Kuzunoha, don't take this personally.

13:22.870 --> 13:24.320
Io is charging at me.

13:25.830 --> 13:27.540
What?

13:27.540 --> 13:31.120
No one says a humanoid form
can only have two arms.

13:31.120 --> 13:33.000
You have four arms yourself.

13:33.350 --> 13:36.170
This isn't a heads-up.
It's a warning.

13:36.170 --> 13:36.960
Io,

13:37.380 --> 13:39.920
if you ever try this again,
I'll kill you.

13:44.620 --> 13:46.010
Rocket punch.

13:46.010 --> 13:46.720
Just kidding.

13:47.560 --> 13:50.060
A meteor flies across the night sky.

13:50.060 --> 13:51.690
Is that a Demon General?

13:51.690 --> 13:52.480
What...

13:52.480 --> 13:55.550
It'd be a shame to kill him.

13:55.550 --> 13:57.650
I've told him to stay away
from Fort Stellar.

13:58.010 --> 14:00.150
That should settle it.

14:00.150 --> 14:02.740
Keep your eyes on me!

14:08.830 --> 14:09.750
What...

14:10.580 --> 14:14.210
I never said
I couldn't reconstruct the mass.

14:18.500 --> 14:21.630
I wonder how good
your defense is in this form.

14:31.310 --> 14:33.520
You do wail like a human, after all.

14:34.900 --> 14:36.270
I'll kill you.

14:37.360 --> 14:39.770
I'm going to kill you!

14:50.410 --> 14:51.660
This side is cleared!

14:51.660 --> 14:53.580
All the demons we can spot are dead.

14:54.150 --> 14:55.750
We're almost done here.

14:55.750 --> 14:57.960
Those with a Rose Sign are too tough.

14:57.960 --> 14:59.170
Cursed demons.

14:59.170 --> 15:01.050
You killed my friends!

15:05.880 --> 15:07.680
Watch out for the mist.

15:07.680 --> 15:10.220
Touching it will weaken you.

15:10.610 --> 15:13.350
There are fewer of them than anticipated.

15:13.980 --> 15:16.560
Has the retreat order come down?

15:17.970 --> 15:19.520
Stay sharp.
Something's coming.

15:29.580 --> 15:31.490
Swords of light.

15:31.490 --> 15:32.160
Is it him?

15:32.660 --> 15:34.330
Is anyone hurt?

15:34.330 --> 15:36.120
Lady Hibiki! Mr. Woody is...

15:36.670 --> 15:38.880
Sorry.

15:39.290 --> 15:41.550
I caught a stray shot.

15:41.550 --> 15:43.460
Start casting the healing spell.

15:43.460 --> 15:44.250
Yes.

15:50.800 --> 15:52.680
What was that?

15:52.680 --> 15:54.560
There's a new enemy?

15:55.100 --> 15:56.480
A dragon?

15:56.480 --> 15:58.520
It's nothing to fear.

15:58.960 --> 16:01.980
I've seen worse things in Tsige.

16:07.550 --> 16:08.740
A Lich.

16:08.740 --> 16:12.410
It doesn't look like
you're an ally of the demons.

16:12.410 --> 16:14.330
Whatever.
I'll spare you.

16:14.330 --> 16:15.160
Leave now.

16:15.160 --> 16:18.210
Lancer the Greater Dragon,
namely the Heavenly Sword.

16:18.210 --> 16:21.000
I never thought we'd meet again.

16:21.000 --> 16:23.960
That stance...
What are you going to do?

16:23.960 --> 16:27.220
My name is Larva,
the Devil's squire.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.800
The Devil?

16:29.110 --> 16:30.510
The Devil?

16:30.510 --> 16:32.640
He brought his sidekick here.

16:35.350 --> 16:37.600
You seem very reasonable.

16:37.600 --> 16:39.810
Let's rumble.

16:49.740 --> 16:51.200
It's my turn now.

16:54.080 --> 16:56.500
That mana mass is strong,

16:56.500 --> 16:59.090
but my killing move
is perfect to counter it.

16:59.790 --> 17:02.130
Sophia can cover me
while I cast it.

17:02.470 --> 17:03.380
Rona.

17:03.380 --> 17:05.380
I don't know what you're scheming,

17:05.380 --> 17:07.590
but if you don't stop
casting the spell,

17:07.930 --> 17:08.890
I'll kill you next.

17:12.300 --> 17:16.220
He was nothing but a naive boy
when we last spoke.

17:16.220 --> 17:18.390
He's acting like
a completely different person.

17:18.390 --> 17:20.310
What's the deal with him?

17:20.940 --> 17:23.270
I was just messing with you, Kuzunoha.

17:23.900 --> 17:27.650
You want us to give up
on the heroes and Fort Stellar, right?

17:27.650 --> 17:30.150
Very well.
I accept the proposal.

17:30.150 --> 17:30.990
What's the catch?

17:31.530 --> 17:33.530
No catch.

17:33.530 --> 17:37.660
I mean it when I say
I wish to bring you to the Demon King.

17:37.660 --> 17:40.000
I see. I'll consider it.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.710
Sophia may be a visiting general,

17:41.710 --> 17:43.880
but she doesn't command any troops.

17:43.880 --> 17:45.710
I can leave her be for now.

17:45.710 --> 17:47.880
Even when you can't guarantee her safety?

17:47.880 --> 17:48.920
Yes.

17:48.920 --> 17:50.090
Whatever the outcome is,

17:50.090 --> 17:52.630
I'll consider it part of the war
and accept it.

17:52.630 --> 17:54.010
Well, you may go now.

17:55.180 --> 17:58.270
You can forget about going after
the heroes when you leave.

17:58.270 --> 18:00.100
Shiki is waiting outside.

18:00.100 --> 18:02.980
I'm not a fool.
I'll take my leave now.

18:03.810 --> 18:04.810
I'm terrified.

18:05.730 --> 18:07.970
It's no wonder he's called the Devil.

18:17.830 --> 18:19.790
A sword is fused with your arm.

18:20.250 --> 18:24.580
This is the manifestation of
the Heavenly Sword's power.

18:24.580 --> 18:27.630
As more of the dragons' power
is unleashed,

18:27.630 --> 18:29.760
we get closer to fusing together.

18:29.760 --> 18:35.190
You can throw away your trump cards
when your foe is weakened.

18:35.930 --> 18:38.220
Do you really think
I won't kill you?

18:38.660 --> 18:41.600
At my age, I'm not naive enough
to think that...

18:41.600 --> 18:43.770
I wouldn't be killed in a fight.

18:43.770 --> 18:44.770
But you?

18:44.770 --> 18:48.570
Your attack packs less power
than the hero of Gritonia.

18:48.570 --> 18:49.860
Is that so?

18:49.860 --> 18:52.070
I've never met the hero in person.

18:52.070 --> 18:54.700
There's no need
to settle the fight in one move.

18:54.700 --> 18:57.370
I'll just have to slowly wear you down.

18:57.370 --> 18:59.030
That was mean.

18:59.470 --> 19:02.620
The other one was a lot more likable.

19:03.750 --> 19:06.330
The attack packs a lot more power.

19:06.680 --> 19:09.210
Not enough to force me
into taking this form,

19:09.210 --> 19:11.000
but still much stronger than you.

19:11.000 --> 19:12.800
You're contradicting yourself.

19:12.800 --> 19:15.220
Not only did he care about his comrades,

19:15.220 --> 19:19.300
but he even had the resolve
to sacrifice his life force.

19:19.300 --> 19:21.310
If I had to pick an ally...

19:21.660 --> 19:24.940
I see. The empire does indeed
have an impressive hero.

19:26.890 --> 19:28.810
As mighty as you are,

19:28.810 --> 19:30.940
you still ended up with
his Charm's seed in you.

19:34.020 --> 19:35.990
You never noticed?

19:35.990 --> 19:38.700
You've lost all resilience against it
before you knew it.

19:39.100 --> 19:43.410
Me? Charmed by that hero?

19:43.850 --> 19:46.700
You mentioned sparing his life.

19:46.700 --> 19:49.170
It's actually because you had
special feelings for him.

19:51.130 --> 19:53.050
You have my pity.

19:53.050 --> 19:56.010
I'll undo his Charm
before we end this fight.

19:57.130 --> 19:58.090
Shut it.

19:58.560 --> 20:00.640
I'm not going to use a sneak attack.

20:00.640 --> 20:03.220
I'll dispel the spell for free.

20:03.220 --> 20:05.060
Didn't you hear me?
Shut up.

20:05.680 --> 20:06.810
Are you sure?

20:06.810 --> 20:09.190
You've probably run out of options.

20:09.520 --> 20:12.230
I told you to shut up!

20:16.070 --> 20:17.390
High-speed dashing?

20:19.070 --> 20:21.700
She still had a trump card up her sleeves.

20:21.700 --> 20:23.330
She is certainly talented.

20:23.830 --> 20:25.790
But this isn't fast enough.

20:33.630 --> 20:36.210
It's time to end this.

20:37.340 --> 20:39.300
Heavenly Sword...

20:39.300 --> 20:42.680
When Heavenly Sword arrives,
we can easily...

20:43.140 --> 20:45.450
I hate to break it to you.
It's not happening.

20:46.810 --> 20:50.650
Even with the Greater Dragons' power,
you're not strong enough.

20:51.980 --> 20:55.650
Our Shiki is much stronger than Lancer.

21:00.040 --> 21:01.620
Burn.

21:05.870 --> 21:07.330
Mr. Larva!

21:07.330 --> 21:08.250
Don't go!

21:08.710 --> 21:10.390
The mist is too thick.

21:14.550 --> 21:18.630
There's no denying
you're the Devil's servant.

21:18.630 --> 21:19.630
How disappointing.

21:19.630 --> 21:22.030
You don't live up to the name.

21:24.720 --> 21:27.220
You haven't lost the will to fight.

21:27.220 --> 21:29.180
I wish we could've met sooner.

21:29.890 --> 21:31.730
Playtime is over.

21:31.730 --> 21:34.150
I'm in a hurry to regroup with Sophia.

21:35.440 --> 21:40.360
Honestly, I'm eager to kill the Devil.

21:40.810 --> 21:44.620
It was only for a brief moment,
but he did break my leg.

21:44.970 --> 21:46.410
Eager to kill?

21:46.410 --> 21:49.330
That's my line, Lancer.

21:49.620 --> 21:50.750
What?

21:50.750 --> 21:53.790
You injured my master.

21:53.790 --> 21:55.340
I'll make you pay for your crime.

21:56.750 --> 21:58.300
You really know how to twist words.

23:35.100 --> 23:39.770
NEXT EPISODE: THE DEVIL VS. THE DRAGON
Night 24: "The Devil vs. The Dragon."
